bieniem</strong>, <em>kursywą</em>, <code>kodem</code> i <a href="/kontakt">linkiem wewnętrznym</a>.</p><h3 id="definicje" data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Definicje</h3><ul data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y="true"><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Usługodawca</li><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Klient<ul data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y="true"><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Usługa doradcza</li><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Usługa szkoleniowa</li></ul></li><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Umowa</li></ul><ol data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y="true"><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Pierwszy krok</li><li data-astro-cid-3pdvfo4y>Drugi krok</li></ol><blockquote data-astro-cid-6amch4or="true">Cytat z wyróżnieniem z lewej strony.</blockquote><div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Tabela, przewijana w poziomie" tabindex="0" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><table style="--columns: 3" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><thead data-astro-cid-6amch4or><tr data-astro-cid-6amch4or><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Pakiet</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Cena</th><th scope="col" data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Czas</th></tr></thead><tbody data-astro-cid-6amch4or><tr data-astro-cid-6amch4or><td data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Start</td><td data-astro-cid-6amch4or>4 500 zł</td><td data-astro-cid-6amch4or>2 tygodnie</td></tr><tr data-astro-cid-6amch4or><td data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Pro</td><td data-astro-cid-6amch4or>6 000 zł</td><td data-astro-cid-6amch4or>3 miesiące</td></tr></tbody></table></div><pre class="code" tabindex="0" data-language="js" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><code data-astro-cid-6amch4or>const lead = await crm.find({ email: &#39;anna@example.com&#39; });
if (!lead) await crm.create(lead);</code></pre><aside class="callout info" role="note" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Informacja: to jest przykładowa ramka z wyjaśnieniem.</p></aside><aside class="callout warning" role="note" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Uwaga: druga linia ostrzeżenia<br data-astro-cid-6amch4or>łamie się ręcznie.</p></aside><p data-astro-cid-6amch4or><a class="download with-icon" href="https://files.zawlodzki.com/przyklad.pdf" download data-astro-cid-6amch4or><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><path d="M7 1h2v8.6l3-3 1.4 1.4L8 13.4 2.6 8 4 6.6l3 3zM2 14h12v2H2z" data-astro-cid-6amch4or></path></svg><span data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Pobierz checklistę (PDF)</span></a></p><figure class="media" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><img src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%201200%20600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22100%25%22%20height%3D%22100%25%22%20fill%3D%22%23e6e8f8%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2250%25%22%20y%3D%2250%25%22%20font-family%3D%22sans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2275%22%20fill%3D%22%233a48cc%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20dominant-baseline%3D%22middle%22%3EOBRAZ%201200%C3%97600%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" sizes="(width &lt; 48rem) 100vw, 47rem" width="1200" height="600" alt="Przykładowy diagram procesu" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><figcaption class="type-body-s" data-astro-cid-6amch4or>Podpis obrazu z CMS.</figcaption></figure><div class="embed" data-astro-cid-6amch4or><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ" title="Przykładowe wideo" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allow="encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen" data-astro-cid-6amch4or></iframe></div></div></div></section><h2 class="ds-label content-grid" data-astro-cid-2n4kpjdp><span data-astro-cid-2n4kpjdp>RichText: najgorszy przypadek</span></h2><section id="rich-wor